(text "Per lane (CK, D0, D1): 2x50R + 100nF split termination; HS AC-coupled (100nF) to the FPGA LVDS pair, biased to VCM 0.9V (27k/10k from 3V3).\nLP: 470R tap from DSI_x_P. D0 -> FPGA pin 85 (1.8V). CK/D1 -> SN74AUP1T17 (3.3V supply) -> pins 25/26 (3.3V bank).\nJ2 = Tang header J6, J3 = Tang header J5 (pin n = pin n). J1 = Duo S CON26A. ROW_PITCH between J2/J3 is ASSUMED." (at 110 20 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid 9b475d6e-49b4-47fd-8809-46b414f306a1))
(sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1"))))
